# Candidate implementation — Task 0001

**Task:** [0001 — Hello, World!](../../../examples/0001-hello-world.md)  
**Status:** Illustrative LLMLang semantic sketch; not parsed, built, executed, or formally verified.

```text
program HelloWorld:
    effects:
        stdout.write

    main:
        result = stdout.write_utf8("Hello, world!\n")

        match result:
            Ok:
                exit(0)
            Error(_):
                exit(1)
```

## Requirement mapping

| Requirement | Implementation |
|---|---|
| R-0001-01 | Exact UTF-8 literal passed to `write_utf8` |
| R-0001-02 | No stderr operation on success |
| R-0001-03 | `exit(0)` after successful write |
| R-0001-04 | Write error maps to nonzero exit |
| R-0001-05 | No argument or stdin access |

